00:38:01.250 --> 00:38:04.430
and how BigQuery actually
recognized this data

00:38:04.430 --> 00:38:06.170
and created the schema.

00:38:06.170 --> 00:38:10.260
So here's my Hacker News table.

00:38:10.260 --> 00:38:16.280
And now I know from Evan that
