00:38:45.110 --> 00:38:48.350
Remember, with this
Hacker News data,

00:38:48.350 --> 00:38:51.860
I'd like to be able to
go to a particular date

00:38:51.860 --> 00:38:53.210
from Hacker News.

00:38:53.210 --> 00:38:57.420
And let's say I want to pick
the top five most highly

00:38:57.420 --> 00:38:58.790
uploaded articles.

00:38:58.790 --> 00:39:01.820
And if you're wondering
