00:39:39.140 --> 00:39:43.670
And here's a prepared SQL
query that I'm going to use.

00:39:43.670 --> 00:39:45.290
So a few things to notice here.

00:39:45.290 --> 00:39:46.880
What's going on in this query?

00:39:46.880 --> 00:39:50.480
This first part of the from
