00:41:20.010 --> 00:41:22.910
And what I'd like to get
are the story scores.

00:41:22.910 --> 00:41:27.210
So let's do a score
and the title, OK?

00:41:27.210 --> 00:41:30.310
And what I'd like to do is
to give a name to this array.

00:41:30.310 --> 00:41:32.010
So let's just go with Stories.

00:41:32.010 --> 00:41:34.500
So the entire array of
my top-scoring articles

00:41:34.500 --> 00:41:36.930
